portscope (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaged development snapshot.
  * Collect local TCP/UDP endpoints (IPv4 and IPv6) with owning process,
    user and systemd unit.
  * Evidence-based endpoint to service association: socket inode, cgroup,
    MainPID, socket activation and Listen=. Never inferred from a port
    number or a process name.
  * Ports, Processes and Services views with search, filtering and sorting.
  * Journal display with severity filtering, text search and per-entry copy.
  * English and Simplified Chinese, switchable at runtime.
  * Settings window, light and dark themes, responsive layout to 1024x600.
  * Runs entirely as the invoking user; no root, polkit or group changes.

 -- PortScope contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
